# VMM source pin (cloud-hypervisor). build.sh clones CH_TAG and compares HEAD
# with CH_COMMIT (the commit the tag points to). A wrong commit is an error.
# An empty commit is a warning only: the build prints the commit to pin.
# Upstream: https://github.com/cloud-hypervisor/cloud-hypervisor (Apache-2.0)
CH_TAG=v54.1
CH_COMMIT=74aeae19cb1ee2c44d33796b0e4e95e1a68e94dd
